[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Trouble with the Hubble]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.59]What is the special importance of a telescope in space? | 太空望远镜有什么特别的重要性？
[00:17.11]The Hubble telescope was launched into | 哈勃望远镜被发射到
[00:19.66]space by NASA on April 20, 1990 at a cost of over a billion dollars. | 太空，由美国国家航空航天局于1990年4月20日发射，耗资10亿多美元。
[00:28.68]Right from the start there was trouble with the Hubble. | 从一开始哈勃望远镜就有问题。
[00:33.84]The pictures it sent us were very disappointing because its main mirror was faulty! | 它发给我们的照片很令人失望，因为它的主镜有毛病！
[00:41.31]NASA is now going to put the telescope right, | 航空航天局现在准备校正望远镜，
[00:45.34]so it will soon be sending up four astronauts to repair it. | 因此不久将把4名宇航员送上太空进行维修。
[00:51.20]The shuttle Endeavour will be taking the astronauts to the Hubble. | “奋进”号航天飞机将把宇航员送到哈勃望远镜那里。
[00:56.33]A robot-arm from the Endeavour will grab the telescope and hold it while the astronauts make the necessary repairs. | 宇航员进行必要的维修时，“奋进”号上的机械臂将抓住望远镜并托住它。
[01:06.35]Of course, the Hubble is above the earth's atmosphere, | 当然，哈勃位于地球大气层之上，
[01:11.24]so it will soon be sending us the clearest pictures of the stars and distant galaxies that we have ever seen. | 因此它不久就会给我们发送所见过的最清晰的恒星和遥远星系的照片。
[01:20.73]The Hubble will tell us a great deal about the age and size of the universe. | 哈勃将告诉我们有关宇宙年龄和大小的许多信息。
[01:27.74]By the time you read this, the Hubble's eagle eye will have sent us thousands and thousands of wonderful pictures. | 等你读到这篇文章时，哈勃的“鹰眼”已向我们发来了成千上万张精彩的照片。
